It is night now.
I am in my flat.
The window is open.
I am standing near the window.
It is not raining now.
The air outside is completely fresh.
The air is very cool.
It was very sunny in the morning.
But it is not hot at all now.
I look down at the street.
The street is completely wet.
There are not many cars on the street.
It is very quiet everywhere.
The cool wind comes in.
I feel very happy.
I check the weather on my phone.
Will it rain tomorrow too?
Yes, it will rain tomorrow evening.
I smile and look outside.
